#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:1
#: 8b1d439deff34ab8996147bc58afaf00
msgid "能量基线平移：去掉巨大的常数能量"
msgstr "Energy Baseline Shift: Remove a Large Constant Energy"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:3
#: 7a7b3b6adedf45638d4aae40fc60251c
msgid ""
"能量基线平移最常见的用途，是在训练前去掉 DFT 总能量中的巨大常数项。某些 "
"ABACUS、CP2K 数据按原子归一后仍可能达到数千甚至数万 eV，而模型真正需要学习的"
"是小得多的结构间能量差。直接用 `float32` 训练时，大数会占用有效位数；先把基线"
"移到零附近，可以给这些小能量差留下更多数值精度。"
msgstr ""
"The most common purpose of energy baseline shifting is to remove a large "
"constant term from DFT total energies before training. Some ABACUS and CP2K "
"datasets can still reach thousands or even tens of thousands of eV per atom, "
"while the model needs to learn much smaller energy differences between "
"structures. With `float32` training, the large values consume significant "
"digits; shifting the baseline close to zero preserves more numerical "
"precision for those small differences."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:5
#: 17e67c6690574a6880b90a0f065788e8
msgid ""
"在 `energy` 图上，这类问题通常表现为 DFT 能量和 NEP 预测**整体错开**，但点云"
"的相对形状仍然一致。平移只处理能量零点，不会让模型本身变准；如果散点很散、弯"
"曲，或者只有少数结构偏离，应先检查模型和数据。"
msgstr ""
"In the `energy` plot, this usually appears as a **systematic offset** "
"between DFT energies and NEP predictions while the relative shape of the "
"point cloud remains the same. Shifting only changes the energy zero; it does "
"not improve the model. If the points are scattered, curved, or only a few "
"structures are off, inspect the model and data first."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:7
#: f06124fac2df4c39800abd43d7f7c74a
msgid "1. 先看能量图"
msgstr "1. Inspect the energy plot first"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:9
#: f56347989a5e4099a2edfbdd42d533ca
msgid ""
"在 `NEP Dataset Display` 中打开带 DFT 能量的数据和对应的 NEP 模型，然后看 "
"`energy` 散点图。"
msgstr ""
"Open the dataset containing DFT energies and its corresponding NEP model in "
"`NEP Dataset Display`, then inspect the `energy` scatter plot."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:11
#: 65df8f8ad78140f7b881487f04fa6fdf
msgid "能量图和能量基线平移按钮"
msgstr "Energy plot and energy baseline shift button"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:11
