#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:16
#: a78477accdc9456eb80a73f114b7ddcb
msgid "确认是巨大的整体基线后，点击工具栏中的 `Energy baseline shift`。"
msgstr ""
"After confirming a large overall baseline, click `Energy baseline shift` in "
"the toolbar."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:18
#: c22415c8f476434b95c107a28dfc16e0
msgid ""
"平移会修改当前数据集里的 `energy`。程序会把第一次平移前的值记在 "
"`energy_original`，但不会自动撤销后续平移。操作前仍建议先导出一份原始数据。"
msgstr ""
"The shift changes `energy` in the current dataset. NepTrainKit records the "
"value before the first shift as `energy_original`, but it does not "
"automatically undo later shifts. Export a copy of the original data first."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:20
#: a72f4fff6f654ad4bef97ba476cc0d08
msgid "2. 按这个例子设置"
msgstr "2. Use these settings"

