#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:27
#: 63871e87ae1847279836b48ef70fe61b
msgid "第一次使用时这样设置即可："
msgstr "For the first run, use the following settings:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:29
#: 966c3657a38d4373a1c015d0798d750c
msgid "`Use existing preset` 保持空白。"
msgstr "Leave `Use existing preset` empty."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:30
#: 04e2dabf0c194f09b4ade6b421ceb530
msgid ""
"如果数据来自同一软件、同一套计算设置，把分组规则填写为 `.*`，让所有 "
"`Config_type` 共用一套基线。"
msgstr ""
"If the data come from the same software and computational settings, enter "
"`.*` so all `Config_type` values share one baseline."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:31
#: 94c65707be384f2787f9d4961f1593fd
msgid ""
"`Alignment mode` 选择 `DFT to NEP`。它根据当前 NEP 预测，拟合每种元素的能量基"
"线，并平移数据集中的 DFT 能量。"
msgstr ""
"Set `Alignment mode` to `DFT to NEP`. It uses the current NEP predictions to "
"fit a baseline for each element and shifts the dataset's DFT energies."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:32
#: 43c5354e65dc4a31bc845e45f2df73b5
msgid ""
"`Max generations`、`Population size` 和 `Convergence tolerance` 先保留默认"
"值。"
msgstr ""
"Keep the default values for `Max generations`, `Population size`, and "
"`Convergence tolerance`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:33
#: b5493ae2358f48dfbc209e9e4deebdc9
msgid "点击 `OK`，等待能量图重新绘制。"
msgstr "Click `OK` and wait for the energy plot to redraw."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:35
#: 66b34752c7c44c9c841122d9c667a9d6
msgid ""
"不要仅因为数据里有多个 `Config_type` 就逐组拟合。即使来自同一软件，每组单独拟"
"合也可能把求解过程中的微小偏差吸收到基线里；同一计算来源使用 `.*` 更稳妥。"
msgstr ""
"Do not fit each group separately just because the dataset contains multiple "
"`Config_type` values. Even for the same software, separate fits can absorb "
"small solver differences into the baselines; using `.*` for one calculation "
"source is more robust."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:37
#: bb411f47b08e459e8e5e410b1cbceea5
msgid ""
"`Config_type` 分组主要用于区分不同能量基线来源。只有数据混合了不同软件时才拆"
"组，例如 `abacus.*;cp2k.*`，多条规则用英文分号 `;` 分隔。不同泛函、赝势或计算"
"精度带来的差异不只影响能量零点，不要靠平移强行混合。"
msgstr ""
"`Config_type` grouping is mainly for distinguishing different energy-"
"baseline sources. Split groups only when the dataset mixes different "
"software, for example `abacus.*;cp2k.*`; separate rules with semicolons. "
"Differences in functionals, pseudopotentials, or numerical settings affect "
"more than the energy zero, so do not force such data together with a shift."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:39
#: 7e7e9fccbdc74ffb8b7df7a811e70a53
msgid "3. 看结果是否正确"
msgstr "3. Check the result"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:41
#: 5a2dee1b0e9146f09522f6c446a726e6
msgid "平移后回到 `energy` 图："
msgstr "Return to the `energy` plot after the shift:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:43
#: 6efa1e46c00944f0be3d7581de71b2d5
msgid "消除整体能量偏移后的散点图"
msgstr "Scatter plot after removing the systematic energy offset"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:43
#: 6efa1e46c00944f0be3d7581de71b2d5
msgid ""
".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/"
"energy_baseline_shift_result.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/"
"energy_baseline_shift_result.png"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:48
#: 77c48ae480fb4b5c8d2b671a0bb5809a
msgid "巨大的绝对能量基线被去掉，能量回到更适合训练的数值范围；"
msgstr ""
"The large absolute-energy baseline is removed, bringing energies into a "
"numerical range better suited to training."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:49
#: eafd11d82e66426aa147792b32ce0599
msgid "点云整体靠近对角线，说明主要差异确实来自能量零点；"
msgstr ""
"The point cloud moves close to the diagonal, indicating that the main "
"difference came from the energy zero."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:50
#: f72571d1d4be4efea73e398ff7c86806
msgid "点云的相对顺序和形状应该基本保留；"
msgstr ""
"The relative ordering and shape of the point cloud should remain largely "
"unchanged."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:51
#: 8960ae2ef36e4e8cbb20b46e27685e28
msgid ""
"如果仍明显散开，不要继续反复平移，转去检查异常结构、分组规则和模型误差。"
msgstr ""
"If the points remain widely scattered, do not repeat the shift. Check "
"abnormal structures, grouping rules, and model error instead."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:53
#: a5b5353c031b41f59631149ffbf8a2b0
msgid ""
"能量基线不是给所有结构减去同一个常数。程序会根据结构中的元素个数，减去对应的"
"逐元素基线。因此，包含不同元素或不同原子数的结构也可以放在同一数据集中处理。"
msgstr ""
"An energy baseline is not one constant subtracted from every structure. "
"NepTrainKit subtracts element-specific baselines according to the element "
"counts, so structures with different elements or atom counts can be handled "
"in one dataset."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:55
#: 1cdb75fbc9cc48b381420d488421bb5e
msgid ""
"确认结果后，用 `Save` 导出新文件，不要覆盖原始训练集。以后需要处理同一类数据"
"时，可以勾选 `Save baseline as preset` 保存本次基线；预设只适用于元素和 "
"`Config_type` 分组方式相符的数据。"
msgstr ""
"After checking the result, use `Save` to export a new file without "
"overwriting the original training set. For the same kind of data in the "
"future, select `Save baseline as preset`; a preset applies only when the "
"elements and `Config_type` grouping match."
